# Gitignore-style excludes for external skill packs (scripts/sync_skill_packs.py).
# Patterns match the pack-relative identity: <pack>/<category>/<skill-name>.
# Everything is included by default; uncomment or add patterns to exclude.
#
# Suggested excludes — Matt's personal/unfinished/retired skills:
# mattpocock/personal/*
# mattpocock/in-progress/*
# mattpocock/deprecated/*
